# Target C: nine-no-root k=5, D=-1, d_root=0, p=5 support narrowing

Date: 2026-09-29

Status: proof-level touched-support reduction followed by an executed exact finite support-level relaxation. This does **not** close the branch. It narrows the only nine-no-root k=5 arithmetic branch that does not already have an exact closure certificate to eight S_7 support-multiset orbits.

